    - target: {fileID: 114039497148008832, guid: 00ab8ab6e599a6a4eb399fcfe7317cca,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: fsm.states.Array.data[9].description
      value: Gary the Gadget Guy did admirably this Halloween.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114039497148008832, guid: 00ab8ab6e599a6a4eb399fcfe7317cca,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: fsm.states.Array.data[10].description
      value: "Despite Island Central being haunted, he rallied teams to take out
        the ghosts and restore our island.\r"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114039497148008832, guid: 00ab8ab6e599a6a4eb399fcfe7317cca,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: fsm.states.Array.data[11].description
      value: "His research shows that Halloween will always be a risky time, but
        that hasn\u2019t discouraged him at all.\r"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114039497148008832, guid: 00ab8ab6e599a6a4eb399fcfe7317cca,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: fsm.states.Array.data[15].description
      value: "I think I like this party more than the holidays. Especially as we
        don\u2019t have to deal with Herbert P. Bear."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114039497148008832, guid: 00ab8ab6e599a6a4eb399fcfe7317cca,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: fsm.states.Array.data[16].description
      value: His attack during the holidays was inexcusable. Imagine, us leaving
        the island due to his threats. Hmph.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114039497148008832, guid: 00ab8ab6e599a6a4eb399fcfe7317cca,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: fsm.states.Array.data[17].description
      value: "I know we haven\u2019t seen the last of him. He wants this island very
        badly, but there are penguins ready to stop him when he does."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114039497148008832, guid: 00ab8ab6e599a6a4eb399fcfe7317cca,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: fsm.states.Array.data[21].description
      value: "Rainbow migrations are rare and spectacular events. It was wonderful
        to see one this year.\r"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114039497148008832, guid: 00ab8ab6e599a6a4eb399fcfe7317cca,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: fsm.states.Array.data[22].description
      value: "The Island Codex has mentioned other unique natural events.\r"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114039497148008832, guid: 00ab8ab6e599a6a4eb399fcfe7317cca,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: fsm.states.Array.data[23].description
      value: "I wonder if we\u2019ll see some of them this year.\r"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114039497148008832, guid: 00ab8ab6e599a6a4eb399fcfe7317cca,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: fsm.states.Array.data[24].description
      value: "All of the decorations for this party came from Crate Co. That company
        is rather curious.\r"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114039497148008832, guid: 00ab8ab6e599a6a4eb399fcfe7317cca,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: fsm.states.Array.data[25].description
      value: "This order was delivered according to plan, but they\u2019ve also sent
        us dozens of empty boxes.\r"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114039497148008832, guid: 00ab8ab6e599a6a4eb399fcfe7317cca,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: fsm.states.Array.data[26].description
      value: Perhaps we can use them to store everything when we pack up on April
        1st.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114039497148008832, guid: 00ab8ab6e599a6a4eb399fcfe7317cca,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: fsm.states.Array.data[29].description
      value: What was your favorite addition to the island this year? It's hard to
        choose.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114039497148008832, guid: 00ab8ab6e599a6a4eb399fcfe7317cca,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: fsm.states.Array.data[30].description
      value: I'm quite pleased with igloos. Rory has done a fine job with them.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114039497148008832, guid: 00ab8ab6e599a6a4eb399fcfe7317cca,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: fsm.states.Array.data[31].description
      value: I also enjoy party games a great deal. There's nothing like a challenging
        battle of wits.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114039497148008832, guid: 00ab8ab6e599a6a4eb399fcfe7317cca,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: fsm.events.Array.data[0].isSystemEvent
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
